description: AGS GTK4 TypeScript widgets under src/ (not ui/)
globs: src/**/*.ts,src/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

# GTK / AGS TypeScript (`src/`)

- Use AGS/GJS imports (`gi://`, `ags/gtk4`, `resource:///com/github/Aylur/ags/...` where the codebase already does). Prefer patterns from existing widgets in `src/widget/`.
- **Sidecar**: use `globalThis.sidecar` / `src/lib/sidecar.ts` for RPC; keep payload shapes aligned with `src/lib/types.ts` and Rust `sidecar/src/types.rs`.
- **Hyprland**: `src/lib/hyprland.ts` and related helpers — reuse instead of ad-hoc `execAsync` where a service exists.
- **Webview shells**: `src/widget/webview/*Window.tsx` own window names and visibility; React pages live in `ui/src/pages/` — do not duplicate large UI in GTK unless intentional.
- **Strict TS**: `strict` is on in `tsconfig.json`; avoid `@ts-ignore` except where GJS typing is genuinely missing (match existing minimal suppressions).
